<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>เข้าสู่ระบบ - Welloff System</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        /* ป้องกัน iOS Auto Zoom */
        input, textarea, select { font-size: 16px !important; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 font-sans antialiased text-gray-900">
    <div class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8">
        <div class="max-w-md w-full p-6 md:p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-gray-50 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-400 to-blue-500"></div>
            
            <div class="text-center mb-8 md:mb-10 pt-2">
                <img src="/uploads/slips/images/logo.png" alt="Welloff System Logo" class="w-24 md:w-28 h-auto mx-auto mb-5 object-contain hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300 drop-shadow-md">
                <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-800">Welloff System</h1>
                <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2 text-sm md:text-base">ยินดีต้อนรับกลับมา! กรุณาเข้าสู่ระบบ</p>
            </div>
            
            <form action="/api/login" method="POST" class="space-y-5 md:space-y-6">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1.5">ชื่อผู้ใช้งาน (Username)</label>
                    <input type="text" name="username" required 
                        class="w-full bg-gray-50 border-gray-200 border p-3.5 rounded-xl focus:bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500 outline-none transition text-base" 
                        placeholder="ใส่ Username ของคุณ">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1.5">รหัสผ่าน (Password)</label>
                    <input type="password" name="password" required 
                        class="w-full bg-gray-50 border-gray-200 border p-3.5 rounded-xl focus:bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500 outline-none transition text-base" 
                        placeholder="••••••••">
                </div>
                
                <button type="submit" 
                    class="w-full mt-2 bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-3.5 md:py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-green-700 shadow-lg shadow-green-200 transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition duration-200 text-base">
                    🔓 เข้าสู่ระบบ
                </button>
            </form>
            
            <div class="mt-8 text-center border-t border-gray-100 pt-6">
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">ยังไม่มีบัญชีใช่ไหม? 
                    <a href="/register" class="text-green-600 font-bold hover:underline">สมัครสมาชิกที่นี่</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>